  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Herat Eartquake Joint Response - Joint Budget</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multiple earthquakes happened in Herat province in the beginning of October 2023. villages around the epicentres have been completely destroyed, and over 250.000 have been affected and are in need of assitance as they lost their homes, their income and livelihoods</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Herat Earthquakes  Joint Response partners will provide support for basic needs after the onset of the crisis, and also will provide early recovery assistance</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">households and communities affected by the households, including female, child and elderly headed households, as well as households with PLWD, and large households.</narrative>
  </description>
